## Rewrite Moves (The Proof Vocabulary)

### Currently Defined

| Move | Categorical Law | Mechanical Feel |
|------|-----------------|-----------------|
| **Slide** | Interchange `(f⊗id) ∘ (id⊗g) = (id⊗g) ∘ (f⊗id)` | Drag independent modules past each other on parallel tracks |
| **Straighten** | Yanking `Tr(id) = id` | Pull an empty loop taut until it vanishes |
| **Thread** | Dinaturality / trace sliding | Lift a module across a loop junction when ports align |

### Future Candidates

- **Bubble** — normalize crossings into swap-layers (swap normalization)
- **Cancel** — cup-cap elimination `ε ∘ (id ⊗ η) = id` (compact-closed)
- **Fuse/Split** — combine/decompose composite boxes (macro operations)

